    @* Start Section description*@
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="col-md-3"></div>
        <div class="col-md-6 " style="text-align:justify;font-size:18px;">
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:2em">The Bakery Project</h1>
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em">Empowering Communities and Fighting Hunger</h1>
            <p>Human Relief Mission runs a remarkable Bakery project in Afghanistan, combining income generation with humanitarian aid. This initiative not only provides employment opportunities for locals but also ensures that needy individuals receive free bread, addressing both economic and food security challenges. The bakery employs local workers, empowering them with a stable income and fostering economic growth within the community. The bread produced is sold to generate revenue, sustaining the project and enabling the distribution of free bread to impoverished families who struggle to afford basic necessities. Your contributions help maintain this vital source of income and sustenance, ensuring the project can continue to provide free bread to those in need while promoting economic stability. By supporting this initiative, you are directly aiding in the fight against hunger and poverty in Afghanistan.</p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/bakery/baker-3.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
            </p>
            @* Start Qoute Section*@
            <div class="" style="padding-bottom:50px;margin-top:30px;">

                <div class="quote-container col-md-12">
                    <span class="" style="font-size:4em;font-weight:bold">&lsquo;&lsquo;</span>
                    <p class="quote">
                        The Prophet ﷺ said: “Worship the most merciful, feed others, spread the greeting of peace, then you will enter Paradise with security”
                    </p>
                    <p class="">Hadith | Tirmidhi</p>
                </div>

            </div>
            @* End Qoute Section*@
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em">Creating Employment and Economic Stability</h1>
            <p>The Bakery project is a cornerstone of our efforts to foster economic growth within Afghan communities. By employing local workers, we empower individuals with stable incomes, enhancing their ability to support their families and contribute to the local economy. This employment not only boosts the financial stability of these workers but also stimulates broader economic activity in the community.</p>

            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em">Providing Free Bread to the Needy</h1>
            <p>A key component of our project is the distribution of free bread to impoverished families who struggle to afford necessities. Thanks to the generous contributions from our donors and partners, we can produce and distribute bread at no cost to those in need. This aspect of the initiative addresses acute food insecurity, providing a reliable source of nourishment to the most vulnerable community members.</p>
            <p>
                <img src="~/Content/projects/bakery/baker-2.jpg" style="width:100%;" />
            </p>
            <h1 style="font-weight:bold;font-size:1em">The Impact of Your Contributions</h1>
            <p>Your contributions play a vital role in maintaining this essential source of sustenance. Donations help us cover the costs of ingredients, equipment, and wages, ensuring the Bakery can continue to operate and expand its reach. By supporting this initiative, you are directly aiding in the fight against hunger and poverty in Afghanistan. Every loaf of bread produced and distributed is a step towards a more stable and prosperous community.</p>


        </div>
